      "expected_event_type": "test_proposal"
    },
    {
      "id": "H10",
      "current_utterance": "The P1 thermal-test report identifies probe P7 and a 30-minute duration, and records 0.2 mm of bracket expansion. The chamber-temperature page is missing and no tip-position measurement was recorded.",
